		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">For a description of the factors relevant to the changes in the value of the above portfolio investments for the year ended December&#160;31, 2025, refer to &#8220;Management&#8217;s Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations&#160;&#8212;&#160;Portfolio Grading.&#8221;</p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Set forth below are descriptions of the ten largest portfolio investments as of December&#160;31, 2025:</p>
		<p class="H3" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="BoldItalic" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">OCP CLO&#160;2024-37, Ltd.</span></p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">OCP CLO&#160;2024<span class="nobreak">-37</span>, Ltd. is a collateralized loan obligation investing primarily in U.S.<span class="nobreak">-based</span> senior secured loans. As of December&#160;31, 2025, approximately $27.0&#160;million remained outstanding on our investment.</p>
		<p class="H3" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="BoldItalic" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Generate CLO 10, Ltd.</span></p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Generate CLO<span class="nobreak"> </span>10, Ltd. is a collateralized loan obligation investing primarily in U.S.<span class="nobreak">-based</span> senior secured loans. As of December&#160;31, 2025, approximately $30.0&#160;million remained outstanding on our investment.</p>
		<p class="H3" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:99;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="BoldItalic" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Verifone, Inc. (f/k/a Verifone Systems, Inc.)</span></p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">Verifone, Inc. develops technology that enables electronic payment transactions and value<span class="nobreak">-added</span> services at the point of sale. As of December&#160;31, 2025, approximately $13.2&#160;million remained outstanding on our investment in the first lien senior secured notes.</p>
