						<p class="Tbody" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:10pt;margin-right:3pt;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-10pt;widows:1;margin-right:0;">You would pay the following expenses on a $1,000 investment, assuming a 5% annual return<span class="Superscript" style="vertical-align:super;font-size:58%;">(1)</span></p>
					</td>
