		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">We have adopted a credit grading system to monitor the quality of our debt investment portfolio. Equity securities are not graded. As of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024 our portfolio had a weighted average grade of 2.2 and&#160;2.3, respectively, based upon the fair value of the debt investments in the portfolio.</p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">At December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, our debt investment portfolio was graded as follows:</p>
