	<div class="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">The weighted average stated interest rate and weighted average maturity on all our debt outstanding as of December&#160;31, 2025 were 6.58% and 3.5&#160;years, respectively, and as of December&#160;31, 2024 were 5.77% and 2.8&#160;years, respectively. The aggregate accrued interest which remained payable as of December&#160;31, 2025, was approximately $1.7&#160;million. The aggregate accrued interest which remained payable as of December<span class="nobreak"> </span>31, 2024, was approximately $1.2<span class="nobreak"> </span>million.</p>
		<p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">The tables below summarize the components of interest expense for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024:</p>
