	<div class="_idGenObjectStyleOverride-1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;border-width:0pt;">
		<p class="H1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">OXFORD SQUARE CAPITAL CORP.</span></p>
		<p class="H1" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:12pt;orphans:1;page-break-after:avoid;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:12pt;"><span class="Bold" style="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">SCHEDULE OF INVESTMENTS &#8212; (continued)<br/>December&#160;31, 2025</span></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;margin-top:8pt;">(8)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_62_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Aggregate gross unrealized appreciation for U.S.&#160;federal income tax purposes is $3,199,699; aggregate gross unrealized depreciation for U.S.&#160;federal income tax purposes is $147,160,305. Net unrealized depreciation is $143,960,606 based upon an estimated tax cost basis of $395,691,951 as of December&#160;31, 2025.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(9)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_64_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Cost reflects accretion of effective yield less any cash distributions received or entitled to be received from collateralized loan obligation (&#8220;CLO&#8221;) equity investments.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(10)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_4_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Totals may not sum due to rounding.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(11)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_6_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Indicates assets that the Company believes do not represent &#8220;qualifying assets&#8221; under Section&#160;55(a)&#160;of the Investment Company Act&#160;of&#160;1940, as amended (the &#8220;1940 Act&#8221;). The Company may include CLO equity side letter related investments within CLO equity subordinated notes line items, and those side letter related investments may represent qualifying assets under Section&#160;55(a)&#160;of the 1940 Act. Qualifying assets must represent at least 70% of the Company&#8217;s total assets at the time of acquisition of any additional non<span class="nobreak">-qualifying</span> assets. As of December&#160;31, 2025, the Company held qualifying assets that represented 68.8% of its total assets.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(12)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_8_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Investment not domiciled in the United&#160;States.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(13)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_10_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Fair value includes the Company&#8217;s interest in subordinated fee notes and represents discounted cash flows associated with fees earned from CLO equity investments.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(14)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_12_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Aggregate investments represent greater than 5% of net assets.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(15)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_14_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The CLO equity investment was optionally redeemed. Expected value of residual distributions, once received, is anticipated to be recognized as return of capital, pending any remaining amortized cost, and/or realized gain for any amounts received in excess of such amortized cost.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(16)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_16_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The principal balance outstanding for this investment, in whole or in part, is indexed to 90<span class="nobreak">-day</span> SOFR.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(17)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_18_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">As of December&#160;31, 2025, this preferred equity investment was on non<span class="nobreak">-accrual</span> status and no dividend income has been recognized on this investment during the year ended December&#160;31, 2025. The aggregate fair value of these investments was approximately $5.0&#160;million.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(18)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_20_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The CLO subordinated notes and income notes are considered equity positions in CLO vehicles. Equity investments are entitled to recurring distributions which are generally equal to the remaining cash flow of the payments made by the underlying fund&#8217;s securities less contractual payments to debt holders and fund expenses. The estimated yield indicated is based on the prior quarters ending investment cost (for previously existing portfolio investments) or the original cost for those investments made during the current quarter, as well as, a current projection of the future cash flows. Such projections are periodically reviewed and adjusted, and the estimated yield may not ultimately be realized.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(19)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_22_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Represents cash equivalents held in a money market fund as of December&#160;31, 2025.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(20)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_26_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The fair value of the investment was determined using significant unobservable inputs. See &#8220;Note&#160;3. Fair Value.&#8221;</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(21)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_28_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The Company holds preferred stock in UniTek Global Services, Inc. that is entitled to receive cumulative preferential dividends at a rate of 20.0% per annum payable in additional shares.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(22)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_30_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The investment is co<span class="nobreak">-invested</span> with the Company&#8217;s affiliates. See &#8220;Note&#160;7. Related Party Transactions.&#8221;</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(23)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_32_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The principal balance outstanding for this investment, in whole or in part, is indexed to 30<span class="nobreak">-day</span> SOFR.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(24)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_34_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">Cost value reflects amortization.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(25)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_36_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">As of December&#160;31, 2025, the effective yield has been estimated to be 0%. The aggregate projected amount of future recurring distributions and terminal principal payment is less than the amortized investment cost.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(26)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_38_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The principal balance outstanding for this investment is indexed to the greater of: (i) the federal funds rate, plus 0.50%; (ii) the prime lending rate; or (iii) the adjusted eurocurrency rate, plus 1.00%. The principal balance outstanding is also subject to a 2.00% annual PIK penalty, as the senior secured notes are past maturity.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(27)<span style="width: 12px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_40_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">The Company&#8217;s SAFE investment in Infinity Constellation Inc. is not debt (no stated interest or maturity) and provides the right to receive equity in the future upon a qualifying equity financing.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Text_flush_Center" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:center;text-indent:0;widows:3;margin-top:12pt;margin-top:12pt;">The accompanying notes are an integral part of these financial statements.</p>
		</div>

