scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-35896">2.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million as of December&#160;31, 2025.</ix:footnote></p>
		<p class="Tablefootnote_m" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:-24pt;widows:3;margin-top:0pt;">(2)<span style="width: 18px;display: inline-block;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><ix:footnote id="ix_80_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">For the <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c351" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="oxsq:UnamortizedDeferredDebtIssuanceCosts" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-35898">5.50</ix:nonFraction>% Unsecured Notes and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c352" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="oxsq:UnamortizedDeferredDebtIssuanceCosts" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-35899">7.75</ix:nonFraction>% Unsecured Notes, fair value is based upon the closing price on the last&#160;day of the period. The <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c353" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="oxsq:UnamortizedDeferredDebtIssuanceCosts" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-35900">5.50</ix:nonFraction>% Unsecured Notes and <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c354" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="oxsq:UnamortizedDeferredDebtIssuanceCosts" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-35901">7.75</ix:nonFraction>% Unsecured Notes are listed on the NASDAQ Global Select Market (trading symbol &#8220;OXSQG&#8221; and &#8220;OXSQH&#8221;, respectively).</ix:footnote></p>
