		<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_InvestmentCompanyFinancialHighlightsTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:InvestmentCompanyFinancialHighlightsTableTextBlock" id="ixv-28657"><p class="Text_ind" style="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8pt;orphans:2;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:left;text-indent:24pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;">The following information sets forth the Company&#8217;s financial highlights for the&#160;years ending December&#160;31, 2025, 2024, 2023, 2022, 2021, 2020, 2019, 2018, 2017, and 2016.</p>
